{
  "episode_id": "ep00_introduction",
  "title": "Wait, Listen to Me",
  "total_duration": 125.1,
  "language": "en",
  "voice_actor": "sohee",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "segment_id": "001",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.0,
      "text": "Wait, wait, wait—listen to me.",
      "emphasis": ["Wait, wait, wait"],
      "style": "urgent"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "segment_id": "002",
      "start": 2.25,
      "end": 4.97,
      "text": "Please stop scrolling for literally two seconds.",
      "emphasis": ["literally two seconds"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "segment_id": "003",
      "start": 5.37,
      "end": 7.45,
      "text": "Look at this drawing right here.",
      "emphasis": ["Look at this drawing"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "segment_id": "004",
      "start": 7.8,
      "end": 14.2,
      "text": "It is supposed to be a hand holding a teacup. It looks like an angry ginger root.",
      "emphasis": ["angry ginger root"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "segment_id": "005",
      "start": 14.7,
      "end": 16.7,
      "text": "Hi. I’m Nemi. I’m 24.",
      "emphasis": ["Nemi", "24"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "segment_id": "006",
      "start": 17.05,
      "end": 21.77,
      "text": "And apparently... I am making animated YouTube videos now.",
      "emphasis": ["animated YouTube videos"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "segment_id": "007",
      "start": 22.12,
      "end": 28.92,
      "text": "I’ve spent years watching storytime creators talk about their lives, and recently my brain had a terrible idea:",
      "emphasis": ["terrible idea:"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "segment_id": "008",
      "start": 29.27,
      "end": 31.19,
      "text": "\"How hard could that possibly be?\"",
      "emphasis": ["How hard"],
      "style": "smug"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "segment_id": "009",
      "start": 31.54,
      "end": 34.5,
      "text": "As it turns out: extraordinarily hard.",
      "emphasis": ["extraordinarily hard"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "segment_id": "010",
      "start": 34.85,
      "end": 45.01,
      "text": "I spent four hours yesterday inbetweening an arm movement. And by the end of it, my character wasn't walking.",
      "emphasis": ["four hours"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "segment_id": "011",
      "start": 45.36,
      "end": 49.04,
      "text": "It looked like they were slipping on three invisible banana peels.",
      "emphasis": ["three invisible banana peels"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "segment_id": "012",
      "start": 49.39,
      "end": 50.51,
      "text": "...In slow motion.",
      "emphasis": ["In slow motion"],
      "style": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "segment_id": "013",
      "start": 51.31,
      "end": 61.23,
      "text": "I go to the gym. Where I walk in with the confidence of an anime hero in a tournament arc... and walk out two sets later completely paralyzed by leg day.",
      "emphasis": ["paralyzed by leg day"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "segment_id": "014",
      "start": 61.58,
      "end": 68.14,
      "text": "And I sing. Mostly in my car with the windows rolled up.",
      "emphasis": ["windows rolled up"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "segment_id": "015",
      "start": 68.49,
      "end": 77.37,
      "text": "...Except last Tuesday when the window was not rolled up, and a mail carrier heard me hit a high G with absolute vibrato.",
      "emphasis": ["absolute vibrato"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "segment_id": "016",
      "start": 77.72,
      "end": 87.16,
      "text": "Like last week, when I spent six entire hours researching the exact structural tension of Victorian iron bridges...",
      "emphasis": ["six entire hours"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "segment_id": "017",
      "start": 87.51,
      "end": 92.95,
      "text": "...just to draw one single background that is on screen for half a second.",
      "emphasis": ["half a second"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "segment_id": "018",
      "start": 93.3,
      "end": 95.38,
      "text": "Half. A. Second.",
      "emphasis": ["Half.", "A.", "Second."],
      "style": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "segment_id": "019",
      "start": 97.18,
      "end": 104.38,
      "text": "...My posture was ruined. My tea was ice cold. But the bridge was architecturally sound.",
      "emphasis": ["architecturally sound"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "segment_id": "020",
      "start": 105.18,
      "end": 114.14,
      "text": "I don't really know where this channel is going yet, but I want to have fun with it, get better at animation, and hopefully meet some cool people.",
      "emphasis": ["cool people"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "segment_id": "021",
      "start": 114.49,
      "end": 120.57,
      "text": "So, if any of that sounds like something you’d enjoy... I’d love it if you stayed.",
      "emphasis": ["stayed"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "segment_id": "022",
      "start": 120.92,
      "end": 124.6,
      "text": "Thank you for watching my very first video. See you in the next one. Bye!",
      "emphasis": ["first video", "Bye!"],
      "style": "standard"
    }
  ]
}
